This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its CORPUS is docs/backlog.archive.md, this repository's own archived backlog, from which it derives
BL-040's receipt at run time; a consumer tree gets no docs/backlog.archive.md at all. On a consumer it
could resolve no archive and no receipt, and a unit that cannot measure scores as a pass in the
consumer's own suite verdict.

It holds the receipt / fixture-arm join (BL-278) that used to run inside
core/fixtures/backlog-receipt-binding/, which carries the same declaration for the same reason. BL-918
moved it here so that an archive edit keys this small unit and not that validator battery.
